     "ex": "Subject: Order automation — summary and next steps\n\nHi Sarah,\n\nThanks again for your time today. Here’s a quick summary:\n• About 35 wholesale orders a week, each taking ~25 minutes by hand\n• Roughly one in ten has a pricing error\n• Priority: invoices out within minutes of payment\n\nNext step: I’ll send a short proposal by Wednesday, and we’ll review it together on Thursday at 3 pm (Dubai time).\n\nBest regards,\nOmar"
